the designated gas licensee, designated entity or designated business trust;
[Act 27 of 2024 wef 01/07/2025]
“30% controller”, in relation to a designated gas licensee, designated entity or designated business trust, means a person, not being a 50% controller, who, alone or together with the person’s associates —
